  "content": "\n\n<h1>讓舊版本（低於 1.8.57）的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SlashBlade: Resharped</a> 相容於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accelerated-rendering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加速渲染</a>。&nbsp;</h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>您仍然可以在此版本以上安裝此模組，但功能將無法運作 :P</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>若您有建議或發現問題，請：</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues &middot; Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade</a></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>或</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests &middot; Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Github：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade：讓所有版本的重鋒相容加速渲染</a></span></strong><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>授權協議：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL-2.1 授權條款</a></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;</strong></span></p>\n<h5><br>讓舊版本（低於 1.8.57）的重鋒相容加速渲染。</h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">高於此版本您仍可安裝該模組，但功能將不會生效 :P</span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><strong>若有建議或問題，請：</strong><br><span styl